Bind Npc 24439 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 14439 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 529 "[Long Revenge] Broken Loyalty"
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Sage of Eslant] Pablo, of Eslant."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Sage of Eslant] Agatha, of Eslant."
    Collect 1 of 910215000

Requires player level >= 61 and quest 528 is completed

Rewards
    Give 125000 experience
    Give 20000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "We need to talk to [Eslant Wise Man]Pablo again. I think Drake and Pablo are very alike."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "We need to talk to [Eslant Wise Man]Agata again. I think Drake and Agata are very alike."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "<selfname>? Long time no see. What brings you here?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Drake sent you? I know how to make the Holy restoration water but...\n\nBring [Broken Soldiers Article] to Pablo."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "<selfname>? Long time no see. What brings you here?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Drake sent you? I know how to make the Holy restoration water but...\n\nBring [Broken Soldiers Article] to Agatha."

On in_progress
    Say "Still not taking care of what you need to bring?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Is that right? It seems like it is full of grudge. You want this to be restored, right?"
